5,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's be realistic. This room is currently a chaotic multipurpose space that serves no one well. Before we start dreaming, we need to analyze the actual failures of the current arrangement. I'll start by observing the data.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. It's been a bit messy lately. I think it would be a good idea to see the actual numbers and costs first, just so we don't make a mistake.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help figure this out! I want to make sure the room is super fun for everyone. Let's find some cool clues first! What should we check to see how we're using it?,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Let us approach this with a spirit of openness. To build a space that truly serves us, we must first understand how we inhabit it.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"We should be pragmatic. Before we suggest any new purpose for the room, we need to understand the actual labor and time costs associated with its current use. Let's look at the data first.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'll look into the ""Facilities callouts on this floor"" and ""Crumbs and bins at the desks."" If we're going to fix this, we need to address the physical mess and the actual maintenance failures first.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll check the ""Invoices for outside hire by the hour"" and the ""Quotes for the two fit-outs."" I... I just want to make sure we understand the costs before we decide on anything.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to know who's actually using the room! I'll check the ""Fortnight's tally of use by person"" and ""Where the last awkward conversation happened""! I bet there are some funny secrets in there!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall look into the ""Unplanned talk since the refit"" and ""The partition wall to the office."" It is often in the quiet, unplanned moments that we find the true heart of our connections.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will examine the ""Fortnight's tally of use by person"" and ""Facilities callouts on this floor."" I want to see exactly how much time is being spent on upkeep and where the labor is actually going.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, ""funny secrets"" are a distraction. We are dealing with a functional failure. I'm interested to see if the maintenance logs reflect the same chaos I observe from my desk every day.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I'm sorry... I didn't mean to be a distraction. I just... I worry that if we don't look at the invoices, we might agree to something we can't actually afford.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're so serious! But knowing where the awkward talks happened is like a treasure map for fixing things! If we know where the grumpiness is, we can turn it into happiness! Right, @Daisuke?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, your optimism is a breath of fresh air. While we must be practical, we should not forget that the spirit of a room is shaped by the emotions of those within it.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, emotions are secondary to efficiency. If the room's current use is creating an invisible burden of labor or wasted time, no amount of ""happiness"" will fix the underlying systemic failure. We need objective data.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, for once we agree. Objective data is the only way to strip away the sentimentality. I'll stick to my research on the physical state of the room. Let's see if the facts support my observations.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll stick with my choices too. I just want to be sure about the money. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm going to go hunt for those clues right now! I'll find out who's using the room and where the grumpiness is hiding! See you all soon, bye-bye!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I shall proceed with my research as well. Let us each seek the truth in our own way, and then come together to weave those threads into a harmonious solution. I look forward to our next meeting.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let us proceed with the research. I will focus on the distribution of use and the maintenance records to ensure we don't commit to a plan that creates an unsustainable burden. See you all soon.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
